# {{appName}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add to your `mix.exs`:

```elixir
defp deps do
  [
    {:{{packageName}}, "~> {{packageVersion}}"}
  ]
end
```

Then run:

```bash
mix deps.get
```

## Quick Start

```elixir
client = {{moduleName}}.{{clientClassName}}.with_token("https://api.example.com", "your-token")
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via authenticator structs passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```elixir
authenticator = {{moduleName}}.Auth.BearerAuthenticator.new("https://api.example.com", "your-token")
client = {{moduleName}}.{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
